From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rijads <spaha92@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:00:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Report /app0/eboot.bin as the executable path on the PS5

A PS5 title always runs from its title folder, and the sandbox refuses the sysctl FreeBSD uses,
which logged a fatal error at every start.
---
 src/openrct2/platform/Platform.Linux.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/openrct2/platform/Platform.Linux.cpp b/src/openrct2/platform/Platform.Linux.cpp
index 3e21ecb..6852c0a 100644
--- a/src/openrct2/platform/Platform.Linux.cpp
+++ b/src/openrct2/platform/Platform.Linux.cpp
@@ -200,6 +200,9 @@ namespace OpenRCT2::Platform
                 break;
             }
         }
+    #elif defined(__PROSPERO__)
+        // A PS5 title always runs from its title folder, and the sandbox refuses the sysctl below.
+        std::strcpy(exePath, "/app0/eboot.bin");
     #elif defined(__FreeBSD__) || defined(__NetBSD__)
         #if defined(__FreeBSD__)
         const int32_t mib[] = {
